From 087f7bcf7db481e6a8590babec794e2b91db95d4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: desocketed <desocketed@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 14:00:43 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Shader hot-reload test switch and on-request frame shots

NX2NAVI_SHADER_RELOAD=1 watches the shader cache folder (inotify). A rewritten
<key>.spv of a shader in memory replaces its SPIR-V; its pipelines and stage
libraries leave the tables (kept alive, not destroyed) and rebuild at the next
draw, and the draw memos look again. A build that fails puts the old SPIR-V and
pipelines back. One log line per reload: key, ok or failed.

With it, a file shot.req beside the cache folder writes the next present at
full size to logs/shot-<n>.png there and is deleted.
---
